# Steam / gaming
# steam-launcher and steam-client are NOT in the main Gentoo tree - they
# come from the third-party steam-overlay repo, added via eselect-repository.
# video_cards_nvidia is wrong for you (that's the proprietary driver flag;
# you're on nouveau/nvk). Real flags below; also see the Gentoo Steam wiki
# page for the list of *other* packages that need abi_x86_32 added
# individually in /etc/portage/package.use/steam - ABI_X86="32 64" in
# make.conf alone does not cover all of them.
games-util/steam-launcher joystick pulseaudio steamruntime udev vulkan wayland
games-util/steam-client joystick pulseaudio steamruntime udev vulkan wayland

